               <msContents>
                  <summary>Fol 13 is thick brown packing paper. Fol. 14 is small sized white paper. Both bound together with the manuscript. Binding repaired with stitches, green thread.</summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i0">
                     <locus from="1v" to="12r">1v-12r</locus>
                     <textLang xml:lang="ar">Arabic</textLang>
                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s35IHA" type="apodous"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>سورة المجادلة اثنان وعشرون اية مدنية \ بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم , قد سمع الله قول التي تجادلك في زوجها وتستكي الي الله </incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#12r">-12r</locus>ومريم ابنت عمران التي احصنت فرجها فنفحنا فيه من روحنا وصدقت بكلمات [ربه] وكتبه</explicit>
                     <note>58:1-66:12. Verse 66:12 incomplete. Titles of suras rubricated. Red triple dots as verse markers. Extension of mīm-s into the margin. Words left incomplete at the end of a line, completed on the following line. Catchwords from another hand, perpendicular to the matn. On one line on fol. 12r,  a red dot above each tā' of the feminine plural ending.</note>
                     <note/>
                  </msItem>
